  "instructions": [
    "Cook the chicken in a little oil over medium heat until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic, ginger, cumin, salt, and pepper to the pot and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the peruvian aji amarillo pepper paste and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the melted butter to the pot, stirring to combine.",
    "Transfer the chicken mixture to a clay tagine.",
    "Cover the tagine and cook over low heat for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the full fat yogurt and cook for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Serve the chicken hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro."
